{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For those who love exploring underwater worlds, *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;* is an exciting and fun adventure for the whole family</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/57864f080a1da8743bb6c028a2f5a403.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=612 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/57864f080a1da8743bb6c028a2f5a403.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/57864f080a1da8743bb6c028a2f5a403.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a colorful and captivating journey as you control *Tigerfish*, a brave tigerfish exploring the depths of an ocean full of secrets and fascinating creatures. Inspired by the Brazilian *tra\u00edra*, a fierce and clever fish, the narrative introduces a challenging but not frightening character. The *tra\u00edra* isn\u2019t a villain but a creature with natural survival instincts. Like the well-known piranha, the *tra\u00edra* is a formidable and fearless predator, representing a thrilling obstacle that adds excitement to the underwater environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/a4e5b03252ce068c4e959ee8b412d8b2.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=612 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/a4e5b03252ce068c4e959ee8b412d8b2.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/a4e5b03252ce068c4e959ee8b412d8b2.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Why play *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;*?** </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**</strong>Captivating and Mysterious Storyline:** Embark on a story full of surprises and explore interconnected environments, where each level reveals more about *Tigerfish*\u2019s journey and the diversity of marine life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/9fe22cee954615c3c2aea0bc58c00523.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/9fe22cee954615c3c2aea0bc58c00523.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/9fe22cee954615c3c2aea0bc58c00523.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Immersive Underwater Exploration:**</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into vibrant and intricately detailed settings, with coral labyrinths, ocean currents, and hidden nooks. With a cheerful cartoon style, the game offers a friendly and engaging atmosphere for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/9eba20a7147bd63028a465c40b09010b.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/9eba20a7147bd63028a465c40b09010b.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/9eba20a7147bd63028a465c40b09010b.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Relaxing and Engaging Challenges:**</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;*, the experience balances action and tranquility, perfect for players looking for lighthearted fun. Face challenging enemies like crabs, pufferfish, and, of course, the fierce *tra\u00edra*, providing a unique challenge for *Tigerfish* without being scary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/920b4879234275ab11b3bf34c5cb32dc.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/920b4879234275ab11b3bf34c5cb32dc.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/920b4879234275ab11b3bf34c5cb32dc.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Cartoon Style and Hand-Drawn Animation:**</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic 2D games and traditional animation, *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;* features a nostalgic and inviting visual style, ideal for adults and children to enjoy together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/93beae89e76ea32a449ba80e473af71a.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/93beae89e76ea32a449ba80e473af71a.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/93beae89e76ea32a449ba80e473af71a.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**For Nature and Marine Life Lovers:**</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment celebrates the ocean\u2019s diversity, with vibrant details that pay tribute to marine biodiversity\u2014a perfect choice for those who appreciate the ocean's beauty and mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you love exploring ocean depths in games and are looking for a relaxing and captivating adventure, *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;* is your next challenge. Conquer treacherous waters, unlock secrets, and take on the depths!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3335980?t=1758630398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3335980?t=1758630398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/9a13eeb01fbf9d5d695abbfb74d880c9490770b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758630398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/9a13eeb01fbf9d5d695abbfb74d880c9490770b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758630398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For those who love exploring underwater worlds, *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;* is an exciting and fun adventure for the whole family</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/57864f080a1da8743bb6c028a2f5a403.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=612 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/57864f080a1da8743bb6c028a2f5a403.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/57864f080a1da8743bb6c028a2f5a403.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a colorful and captivating journey as you control *Tigerfish*, a brave tigerfish exploring the depths of an ocean full of secrets and fascinating creatures. Inspired by the Brazilian *tra\u00edra*, a fierce and clever fish, the narrative introduces a challenging but not frightening character. The *tra\u00edra* isn\u2019t a villain but a creature with natural survival instincts. Like the well-known piranha, the *tra\u00edra* is a formidable and fearless predator, representing a thrilling obstacle that adds excitement to the underwater environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/a4e5b03252ce068c4e959ee8b412d8b2.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=612 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/a4e5b03252ce068c4e959ee8b412d8b2.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/a4e5b03252ce