ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/9eba20a7147bd63028a465c40b09010b.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Relaxing and Engaging Challenges:**</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;*, the experience balances action and tranquility, perfect for players looking for lighthearted fun. Face challenging enemies like crabs, pufferfish, and, of course, the fierce *tra\u00edra*, providing a unique challenge for *Tigerfish* without being scary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/920b4879234275ab11b3bf34c5cb32dc.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=608 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/920b4879234275ab11b3bf34c5cb32dc.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/920b4879234275ab11b3bf34c5cb32dc.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Cartoon Style and Hand-Drawn Animation:**</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic 2D games and traditional animation, *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;* features a nostalgic and inviting visual style, ideal for adults and children to enjoy together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/93beae89e76ea32a449ba80e473af71a.poster.avif?t=1758630398\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/93beae89e76ea32a449ba80e473af71a.webm?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/extras/93beae89e76ea32a449ba80e473af71a.mp4?t=1758630398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**For Nature and Marine Life Lovers:**</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment celebrates the ocean\u2019s diversity, with vibrant details that pay tribute to marine biodiversity\u2014a perfect choice for those who appreciate the ocean's beauty and mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you love exploring ocean depths in games and are looking for a relaxing and captivating adventure, *&quot;Tra\u00edras&quot;* is your next challenge. Conquer treacherous waters, unlock secrets, and take on the depths!</strong></p>","developers":["Marcos Riffel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335980/header.jpg?t=1758630398","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3335980/662601298/6e73d5571e6dd77b315dceb3dbbd06b1fd9bc606/1758570268/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758572401","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3335980/662601298/6e73d5571e6dd77b315dceb3dbbd06b1fd9bc606/1758570268/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758572401","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3335980/662601298/6e73d5571e6dd77b315dceb3dbbd06b1fd9bc606/1758570268/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758572401","id":257204257,"name":"new trailler","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204257/d632415a13f43394e7a209868399e827960421a3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758572401"}],"name":"Tra\u00edras","package_groups":